<item><title>Natembeya&apos;s aide in intensive care after night attack</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ke/natembeya-s-aide-in-intensive-care-after-night-attack-15b86e/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ke/natembeya-s-aide-in-intensive-care-after-night-attack-15b86e/</guid><category>Kenya</category><description>Amos Boaz, a political ally and communication officer of Trans Nzoia Governor George Natembeya, was attacked by unknown assailants on Monday night.</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 09:16:33 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ke.jpg" length="31123" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ke.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
